'' A field declared '= any' is left alone: no zero fill, no member constructor, no
'' store -- and a dynamic array field beside it still gets its descriptor.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/mir/src/field-init-any.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-OUT: 0 statements not lowered

'' t1: ONE memset, of 4 bytes at offset 4, and not 8 at offset 0.
'' EXPECT-OUT: field.addr $0, 4
'' EXPECT-OUT: memset(%1, 0, 4)

'' t6's constructor calls inner's nowhere. Nothing in this file may call it: 'inner'
'' is constructed only as a field of t6, and that field says 'any'.
'' EXPECT-NOT: call void _ZN5INNERC1Ev

'' ...but the dynamic array field is still built, element size and all.
'' EXPECT-OUT: const i64 17
